"旧友" = "Old Friend";
"旧友が待つ無音の核。音視も近道も届かない場所で、見えないまま作ってきた戻る道を確かめる。" = "The Silent Core where the old friend waits. In a place where sound-sight and shortcuts cannot reach, confirm the path back built without seeing.";
"旧友の声：ただの反復だ" = "Old Friend's Voice: Mere Repetition";
"旧友の声：俺が捨てた道" = "Old Friend's Voice: The Path I Abandoned";
"旧友の声：見えていないのか" = "Old Friend's Voice: You Do Not See?";
"旧友の声：見える者か" = "Old Friend's Voice: One Who Sees?";
"旧友の笑みがわずかに歪む。\n「なぜ止まらない。見えていない者が、なぜここまで戻ってこられる。そんなものは道ではない。ただの反復だ。……なら、俺が沈んだ理由は何だった。」" = "The old friend's smile twists slightly.\n\"Why do you not stop? How can someone who cannot see return this far? That is not a path. It is only repetition. ...Then why did I sink?\"";
"旧友は初めて目を見開いた。\n「見えない者にも、道はあったのか。俺は、戻り方を知らなかっただけか。」\n彼は無音の核へ伸ばしていた手を下ろした。沈黙は世界を覆う力を失った。" = "For the first time, the old friend's eyes opened wide.\n\"So even those who cannot see had a path. I simply did not know how to return.\"\nHe lowered the hand he had stretched toward the Silent Core. The silence lost its power to cover the world.";
"旧友は薄く笑った。\n「まだ戻ってくるのか。ここでは音視も近道も役に立たない。見えないまま進むなら、残るのは間違いと反復だけだ。」" = "The old friend gave a faint smile.\n\"You still come back? Sound-sight and shortcuts are useless here. If you move on without seeing, all that remains is error and repetition.\"";
"明るく安定した三つのまとまり。" = "A bright, stable three-note shape.";
"明るさの上に遠い七度を置く。" = "Places a distant seventh over brightness.";
"明るさの中に浮いた四度を置く。" = "Places a floating fourth inside brightness.";
"暗く沈むが、根へ戻る力は残る。" = "Dark and sinking, but it still has force back to the root.";
"暗さと遠い七度が同居する響き。" = "A sound where darkness and a distant seventh coexist.";
"最初から道があったわけじゃない。戻るたびに、道にしてきたんだ。" = "The path was not there from the beginning. Each return made it into a path.";
