"水土黄夕霧氷へ連なる険路。深い根ほど重く、中心へ向かう足取りを試す。" = "A steep path linking Water, Earth, Yellow, Evening, Mist, and Ice. The deeper the root, the heavier it feels, testing each step toward the center.";
"水殿の柱に灰と氷と霧がまとわりつく。静かな景色ほど根を見失いやすい。" = "Gray, ice, and mist cling to the pillars of the water hall. The quieter the scene, the easier it is to lose the root.";
"水灯の帰路 F/C" = "Water-Lamp Return Path F/C";
"水路と橋がめぐる薄緑の拠点。Fの根を水音とともに拾い、流れを崩さない。" = "A pale-green outpost of waterways and bridges. Pick up the F root with the sound of water and keep the flow intact.";
"水路と緑庭に囲まれた拠点。Eの根を静かに決め、余分な力みを抜く。" = "An outpost surrounded by waterways and green gardens. Settle the E root quietly and release unnecessary tension.";
"水響が巡る運河の街。" = "A canal town where water-resonance circulates.";
"水響の運河と石橋が交差する近郊。Fのオーラは柔らかく、流れに遅れると一気に崩れる。" = "A nearby area where Water-Resonance canals and stone bridges cross. The F Aura is gentle, but falling behind the flow can make everything collapse at once.";
"水響街から灯火港へ戻る帰路。始まりの根へ戻るほど、最初の意味が変わる。" = "The return road from Water-Resonance Town to Lamplight Harbor. The more you return to the first root, the more its first meaning changes.";
"氷と霧の鏡に夕影と黄塵が映る庭。正しい音だけが像を結ぶ。" = "A garden where evening shadow and yellow dust appear in mirrors of ice and mist. Only the right sound forms a clear image.";
"氷鏡が光る冷たい街。" = "A cold town lit by ice mirrors.";
"氷鏡の谷へ降りる白い石段。G♭のオーラは冷え切っており、反射で選ぶ力が問われる。" = "White stone steps descend into the Ice-Mirror Valley. The G♭ Aura is ice-cold, testing the power to choose by reflection.";
"氷鏡街の奥に沈む鏡穴。G♭とD♭が霧の中で何度も反射する。" = "A mirror hollow sunk deep inside Ice-Mirror Town. G♭ and D♭ reflect again and again in the mist.";
