"港外れの灯台跡に、調律を乱された生き物が集まる。Cへ戻り、そこから一音ずつ数える最初の実戦。" = "Aura Creatures with disturbed tuning gather at the old lighthouse outside the harbor. This is the first real fight: return to C, then count one sound at a time.";
