"灯、風、砂、雷の四つが外郭を作る古い防衛区。速さよりも戻る場所を問われる。" = "An old defensive ward where lamp, wind, sand, and thunder form the outer wall. It asks where you return, not how fast you move.";
"灯火港" = "Lamplight Harbor";
"灯火港の奥、Cの赤い灯がGの青風へ流れ込む浅い洞。二つの根を聞き分ける最初の境目。" = "A shallow cave beyond Lamplight Harbor, where C's red light flows into G's blue wind. The first boundary for distinguishing two roots.";
"灯風砂雷の郭 C/G/D/A" = "Lamp-Wind-Sand-Thunder Ward C/G/D/A";
"灯風砂雷翠灰へ連なる険路。明るい根ほど鋭く、中心へ向かう道を細くする。" = "A steep path linking Lamp, Wind, Sand, Thunder, Green, and Gray. The brighter the root, the sharper it becomes, narrowing the road toward the center.";
"灰塔が空を裂く工房街。" = "A workshop town where a gray tower cuts through the sky.";
"灰塔の外壁が続く防衛区画。拍に押されるほど、手元の根へ戻る必要がある。" = "A defensive district lined by the outer walls of the Gray Tower. The more the beat pushes, the more you must return to the root under your hands.";
"灰塔の石壁が氷鏡の冷気に侵された回廊。音の輪郭が鋭く削られる。" = "A corridor where the Gray Tower's stone walls are invaded by the chill of the Ice-Mirror. The outline of sound is cut sharp.";
