"砂時計の塔が立つ黄土の拠点。乾いた響きに急かされても、Dへ戻る手順を崩さない。" = "An ocher outpost where an hourglass tower stands. Even when dry resonance hurries you, keep the steps for returning to D.";
"砂色の鐘楼跡が残る台地。判断が遅れても、戻る場所を取り直せば続けられる。" = "A plateau with the ruins of a sand-colored bell tower. Even if your judgment is late, you can continue by taking the place to return again.";
