"砂鐘の台地に紫雷が落ちて開いた裂け目。判断の遅れがそのまま敵の拍になる。" = "A rift opened when violet thunder struck the Sandbell Plateau. Any delay in judgment becomes the enemy's beat.";
"砂鐘の音が響く台地の街。" = "A plateau town where the sandbell resounds.";
