"紫の花と稲光が瞬く丘の拠点。揺れる光に惑わされず、Aを起点に数える。" = "A hill outpost where violet flowers and lightning flicker. Do not be misled by the wavering light; count from A.";
"紫の花影に雷光が走る回廊。ためらいより先に、根へ戻る癖が試される。" = "A corridor where thunderlight runs through violet flower-shadows. It tests the habit of returning to the root before hesitation.";
"紫光が棚引く丘の街。" = "A hill town where violet light trails across the sky.";
"紫翠の水脈 A/E" = "Violet-Green Water Vein A/E";
