"翠の庭園が広がる水辺の街。" = "A waterside town spread with green gardens.";
"翠庭から灰塔へ続く古い廃路。穏やかな響きの裏で硬いBが待つ。" = "An old abandoned road from Green Garden to the Gray Tower. Behind the calm resonance, the hard B waits.";
