"見えていなくていい。戻る場所を覚えてきた。" = "It is all right not to see. We have learned where to return.";
"見えないまま、戻りながら進む" = "Move forward unseen, by returning.";
"見えないままでいい。もう、選べる場所に立っている。思うままに、鳴らしていい。" = "It is fine not to see. You are already standing where you can choose. Let it sound as you wish.";
"見えないまま進むな。" = "Do not move forward without seeing.";
"見えない者が数え続けても、誰も待たなかった。外せば、足りないのは心だと言われた。" = "No one waited for those who had to keep counting without seeing. Miss once, and they said the problem was your will.";
"見えない者が進めるなら、俺が捨てたものは何だった。" = "If one who cannot see can still move forward, what was it that I threw away?";
"見えない者にも、道はあったのか。俺は、戻り方を知らなかっただけか。" = "So there was a path even for one who could not see. Did I simply not know how to return?";
"見えなくても、帰る場所さえあれば選び直せる。まずはCへ戻るところから始めよう。" = "Even without seeing, you can choose again if you have a place to return to. Start by returning to C.";
"見える者の道にするつもりはない。戻る道を作っている。" = "I do not intend to make it a path for those who see. We are building a path back.";
"見える者も、見えない者も、同じ沈黙に沈む。" = "Those who see and those who do not will sink into the same silence.";
"覚えた？　数えた？　そんなものが道になるわけがない。" = "Learned? Counted? That cannot become a path.";
